t(32, 2295, """If the news is true and not a deception, then in the depth of the idea that does not die except by the annihilation of all who carry it, all truces are temporary and all time-buying agreements are a deception, because the demolition of the strategy as an idea represents an inevitable fall. And whoever lives on the sanctity of the idea and the narcissism of the ego, reads history from the angle of his devil, makes calculations of hegemony and control over the world and mankind and recognizes no one else, sees the whole world as an enemy and the whole earth as his right, sees that the old age of his country has reached its farthest limit, believes in invented sanctities he thinks are beyond doubt, and lives a real crisis, not an illusion, is worthy of being taken out of history, truly without exaggeration. His retreat is either a real descent from the world stage and a real end, or he is buying time because the stock has truly run out! Only the stock has run out, but the spark will keep wavering, because what a nation carries of strategy is a crisis, meaning the master sees what people do not see. If he retreats, the whole weight will collapse and everything will be smashed, and there will be no hope of holding firm in the face of the new powers. What happened was not ordinary, but a real tearing of the previous picture that has dominated the world since 1990. So both pieces of news today make a new world, paving the way for the great Taiwan crisis.""")

