t(33, 1300, """The acceleration of events and the buying of time from events, and their interactions, are a hidden unseen; but if the matter truly happens, I entrust you all to Allah, and until we meet, Allah the Exalted willing. I advise you and myself to fear Allah, to be calm and wise, to prostrate much, to make much dhikr and tasbih, and to cooperate until Allah the Exalted lifts the distress, and I ask Him the Exalted that it not be prolonged. O Allah, amen""")

