t(33, 2470, """The way of Allah, our Mighty Lord, on earth is fixed and does not change. Who convinced some people that prophets were sent to righteous peoples?! Who convinced some people that Qutuz, Saladin and Ertugrul came out in eras when the Muslims were God-fearing, pure, righteous and victorious?! How did this amount of ignorance and this scene of intellectual stupidity come out to us on screens, when we hear one of them say: societies must become pure, clean and""")

t(34, 160, """righteous so that Allah the Exalted saves them from their pains, sorrows and setbacks?!

There may be a million ignorant people in the world, stupid of thought, but you must not walk behind his stupidity and sell him your mind and understanding!""")

h(34, 1150, """Salvation is always like this!""")

t(34, 1385, """Whoever is annihilated in Allah's will is given power over this world as a master, not as a human .. Empowerment on earth is of two kinds. One a blessing and the other a punishment! One for good and the other for evil! One a mercy and a choosing from our Mighty Lord, and the other a gradual leading to ruin and a punishment in this world and the Hereafter! Let man not be deceived by temporary empowerment, for it is short and does not last long, of whatever kind, wealth or strength. This is when the annihilation is in Satan; it does not last! 10 years, or 20 or 40 .. all this is short-lived .. and in empires 80 years?! What is the value of 80 years?! Nations and states have ruled 2000 years and 1000 years!

As for annihilation in Allah's will, it is something else. Another world, and a heavenly, not an earthly, power. While the one annihilated in Satan's will toils and struggles, bearing a thousand hardships to preserve his wealth or his might so that his swelling and puffing up may continue, the one annihilated in the will of Allah the Mighty bears no hardship in making truth and good dominate reality, because every difficulty is made easy for him with a "Be, and it is" or with the easiest of means. And how not, when the one annihilated in Allah's will is a friend (wali) of Allah? And since when does our Mighty Lord not grant victory to one annihilated in His will? It has never happened since Adam, peace be upon him.

For this reason, do not fear annihilation in Allah's will, for if you do it you have put this world under your feet, and you are given the companionship of those like you, and Allah opens to you openings not from the books of men, and you grasp with your heart an understanding not grasped with a thousand higher degrees, and you see the truth bare, exposed and easy to absorb wherever your mind alights, and you are granted soundness of heart, strength of logic, clarity of thought, the resolve of those who take the Book with strength, and you tread the earth as those whom Allah chose to reform it tread it. So your understanding becomes light and your striving success, and the love of the Most Merciful for you becomes the pearl of the crown of that great relationship between a servant and his Lord, and all this and more for one reason:

That you chose to be annihilated in Allah's will when many around you in society chose to be annihilated in the will of the accursed Satan.""")

h(35, 400, """Annihilation in Allah's will!""")

t(35, 835, """They will leave history as an empire either by a Nagasaki or by withdrawal! They will choose Nagasaki!

((War 3))
The world is returning to the settings of 1975, 1979, 1980 and 82

After referring knowledge to Allah, our Mighty Lord, Knower of the unseen and the seen,
An analysis built on multiple old personal dreams, a scientific foresight from my information, together with something hidden in the heart!

The result: no America .. (poverty) .. an agricultural and fishing economy, weak trade, and the end of the era of privileged living. What will remain of it!

And the result: a China starting from a little above zero, determined to manufacture anew. What will remain of China! Likewise Korea and Japan .. what remains of them!

And the result too: a rural, not industrial, Russia (old Russia)

And the result: a rural Japan and Korea with a desire for financial support to return to industry

And the result: a Europe that cannot provide liquidity for any kind of luxurious living! With a desire for financial support to return to industry.

The two poles of industry in the world will be what remains of East Asia and Europe .. not the industry of 2026 .. the industry of 1979, a little less or a little more!

All the nations of the earth after the war will need two basic things .. oil and money ..

And oil and money will be under the control of the Middle East exclusively!

Because no entity will remain .. the entity will evaporate!""")

